  "description": "Ji-Soo, who was strangely rejected by men, starts dating Tae-Joon, her brother's friend, but hides this fact from her brother Ji-Sung. Ji-Sung, Ji-Soo, and Tae-Joon end up drinking together at home. The two, who have been dating for a month, feel hot just by making eye contact, and eventually, even in the house with Ji-Sung, they are busy exploring each other. \n\nWill their risky sex be able to stay hidden until the very end?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
